--- !u!114 &392744337
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 392744336}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 445e13603f407004589a4378f99edb2c, type: 3}
  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::DersNotu
  dersBasligi: "Mod\xFCl 3 | Ders 4 | Nokta \xC7arp\u0131m"
  amac: "Bu sahne dersin sonundaki durumdur. GorusKonisi beti\u011Fi Dusman nesnesine
    eklenmi\u015Ftir. Oyuncu nesnesini s\xFCr\xFCkleyin ya da Dusman nesnesini d\xF6nd\xFCr\xFCn.
    Koni k\u0131rm\u0131z\u0131ya d\xF6nd\xFC\u011F\xFCnde d\xFC\u015Fman oyuncuyu
    g\xF6r\xFCyordur.\n\nBir d\xFC\u015Fmana g\xF6r\xFC\u015F konisi veriyoruz. D\xFC\u015Fman\u0131n
    ileri y\xF6n\xFC ile oyuncuya giden y\xF6n\xFCn nokta \xE7arp\u0131m\u0131n\u0131
    al\u0131yor, sonucu bir e\u015Fikle kar\u015F\u0131la\u015Ft\u0131r\u0131yoruz.
    Oyuncuyu sahnede gezdirerek nokta \xE7arp\u0131m\u0131n, a\xE7\u0131n\u0131n
    ve uzakl\u0131\u011F\u0131n nas\u0131l de\u011Fi\u015Fti\u011Fini ve d\xFC\u015Fman\u0131n
    oyuncuyu ne zaman g\xF6rd\xFC\u011F\xFCn\xFC izliyoruz."
  adimlar:
  - "Ders04_Baslangic sahnesini a\xE7\u0131n. Project penceresinde Betikler klas\xF6r\xFCndeki
    GorusKonisi beti\u011Fini a\xE7\u0131n ve Hesapla fonksiyonunu okuyun. Nokta
    \xE7arp\u0131m\u0131n ve e\u015Fi\u011Fin hesapland\u0131\u011F\u0131 sat\u0131rlar\u0131
    bulun."
  - "Hierarchy'de Dusman nesnesini se\xE7in. GorusKonisi beti\u011Fini Inspector'a
    s\xFCr\xFCkleyin. Hierarchy'deki Oyuncu nesnesini beti\u011Fin Hedef alan\u0131na
    s\xFCr\xFCkleyin. Zeminde g\xF6r\xFC\u015F konisi belirir. Oyuncu tam kar\u015F\u0131da
    oldu\u011Fu i\xE7in nokta \xE7arp\u0131m 1, a\xE7\u0131 0 g\xF6r\xFCn\xFCr ve
    koni k\u0131rm\u0131z\u0131d\u0131r."
  - "Oyuncu nesnesini se\xE7in ve Position X de\u011Ferini 2 yap\u0131n. Nokta \xE7arp\u0131m
    0.89, a\xE7\u0131 27 olur. De\u011Fer e\u015Fi\u011Fin \xFCst\xFCnde oldu\u011Fu
    i\xE7in koni k\u0131rm\u0131z\u0131 kal\u0131r."
  - "Oyuncu konumunu 5, 0.5, 2 yap\u0131n. Uzakl\u0131k 5.39 ile menzilin i\xE7indedir
    ama nokta \xE7arp\u0131m 0.37 de\u011Ferine d\xFC\u015Fer. Koni sar\u0131ya d\xF6ner."
  - "Oyuncu konumunu 0, 0.5, -4 yap\u0131n. Nokta \xE7arp\u0131m -1 olur ve yaz\u0131da
    arkada s\xF6zc\xFC\u011F\xFC g\xF6r\xFCn\xFCr."
  - "Oyuncu konumunu 0, 0.5, 8 yap\u0131n. Nokta \xE7arp\u0131m 1 olmas\u0131na kar\u015F\u0131n
    uzakl\u0131k menzili a\u015Ft\u0131\u011F\u0131 i\xE7in koni sar\u0131 kal\u0131r.
    Oyuncuyu 2, 0.5, 4 konumuna geri al\u0131n."
  - "Dusman nesnesini se\xE7in ve Rotation Y de\u011Ferini 90 yap\u0131n. Koni d\xFC\u015Fmanla
    birlikte d\xF6ner ve oyuncu koninin d\u0131\u015F\u0131nda kal\u0131r. De\u011Feri
    yeniden 0 yap\u0131n."
  - "Play tu\u015Funa bas\u0131n. Scene penceresinde Oyuncu nesnesini s\xFCr\xFCkleyin.
    Oyuncu koninin i\xE7ine girdi\u011Finde Dusman k\u0131rm\u0131z\u0131ya, \xE7\u0131kt\u0131\u011F\u0131nda
    griye d\xF6ner."
  - "Play modundayken Dusman nesnesinde Gorus Acisi de\u011Ferini 180 yap\u0131n.
    D\xFC\u015Fman menzil i\xE7inde \xF6n\xFCndeki her \u015Feyi g\xF6r\xFCr. Play
    modundan \xE7\u0131k\u0131n."
  kendinDene:
  - "Gorus Acisi de\u011Ferini 30 yap\u0131n. E\u015Fik ka\xE7 olur? Oyuncuyu koninin
    tam kenar\u0131na getirip nokta \xE7arp\u0131m\u0131 okuyun."
  - "Menzil de\u011Ferini 3 yap\u0131n ve oyuncuyu d\xFC\u015Fmana do\u011Fru y\xFCr\xFCt\xFCn.
    Koni hangi uzakl\u0131kta k\u0131rm\u0131z\u0131ya d\xF6n\xFCyor?"
  - "Oyuncu nesnesinin Y de\u011Ferini 5 yap\u0131n. Nokta \xE7arp\u0131m ve a\xE7\u0131
    nas\u0131l de\u011Fi\u015Fiyor? Neden?"
  - "Betikte ko\u015Fuldaki b\xFCy\xFCkt\xFCr i\u015Faretini k\xFC\xE7\xFCkt\xFCr
    yap\u0131n. D\xFC\u015Fman art\u0131k nereyi g\xF6r\xFCyor?"
